  speakerName: "Ph\xF3 l\xE0ng"
  title: "Khai th\xE1c t\xE0i nguy\xEAn"
  content: "\"Worker s\u1EBD t\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ED9ng khai th\xE1c \u0111\xE1, l\xFAa,
    g\u1ED7 v\xE0 \u0111\u01B0a v\u1EC1 kho ri\xEAng. Sau \u0111\xF3 worker v\u1EADn
    chuy\u1EC3n s\u1EBD gom t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 v\u1EC1 kho t\u1ED5ng \u0111\u1EC3 c\u1EADu
    s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng.\""
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
